{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d46ac6dda5384866","name":"Remote Processor","source":{"id":"source:reference-d46ac6dda5384866","title":"Remote Processor","revision":18452,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:09:08Z","sha256":"353057da1ca07e473cc0d867b6c170d1ee4955d429c67c05733e6fe4f0b111e8","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18452","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Remote%20Processor&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d46ac6dda5384866","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["REMOTE PROCESSOR\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["WEIGHT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["AVAILABILITY\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5-km Range\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10 kg\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Unlicensed\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["50-km Range\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["100 kg\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Unlicensed\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["500-km Range\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["100,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1,000 kg\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5,000-km Range\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1,000,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10,000 kg\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The Droid's Processor isn't located in the Droid; instead, the Droid is actually a drone for a Remote Processor. The Remote Processor is equipped with a transmitter that allows a Droid equipped with the appropriate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Remote Receiver"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Remote_Receiver","referenceId":"reference:8f6ae62e76ddc3da"}," to operate as far away as 5 km (for the least expensive model) to as much as 5,000 km (for the most expensive model). The advantage of a Remote Processor is that it makes the Droid much less expensive because it only needs a receiver instead of a local control system. The drawback is that the Droid doesn't react as quickly as a Droid with an internal Processor, so it suffers a -2 penalty to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
